This repository is published so that breeders can read, verify and correct the
genetics it implements. It is not published as open source, and no licence to
reuse it is granted by its visibility.

PERMITTED WITHOUT ASKING

  1. Reading, studying and auditing this source code.
  2. Using the live site at lovebirdgenetics.com, free of charge, for any
     purpose including commercial breeding operations.
  3. Quoting short excerpts for review, teaching, journalism or scientific
     discussion, with attribution to KinBird Aviary and a link to the site.
  4. Reporting errors, including genetics errors. Corrections are welcome and
     are credited.

NOT PERMITTED WITHOUT PRIOR WRITTEN PERMISSION

  1. Copying, redistributing or republishing this code, in whole or in
     substantial part, in any form.
  2. Creating derivative works, including ports to other species, other
     languages, other frameworks, mobile applications or hosted services.
  3. Reusing the genetics engine, its data tables, its mutation model or its
     article content in any other product, whether free or paid.
  4. Removing or obscuring these notices or the attribution on any page.
  5. Automated bulk extraction of the site or this repository, including
     scraping for the purpose of training or populating a competing product.

